                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d323-f3" n="3" xml:id="d323-f3-content">
                <p>Telegram 915, from Berlin to Paris, November 13, <ref target="#pg496">p.
                        496</ref>. Telegram 921, November 14, from Berlin to Paris, not printed,
                    transmitted the text of General Clay’s
                    message CC–6717, November 13, <ref target="#pg494">p. 494</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
